<title>BRAZIL: Sao Paulo November unemployment 14.5 pct -- Dieese.</title>
<headline>Sao Paulo November unemployment 14.5 pct -- Dieese.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Labor Union Statistics Institute (Dieese) reported the unemployment rate in the city of Sao Paulo dropped to 14.5 percent in November from 14.8 percent in October.</p>
<p>The number of unemployed workers was 1.240 million in November, slightly down from 1.266 million in October, it said.</p>
<p>In November 1995 the unemployment rate was 13.7 percent, or 1.137 million workers, it said.</p>
<p>((-- Alexandre Caverni, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 55-11-2485418))</p>
